  description: "2 Level 8 monsters\nIf this card has a \"Photon\" card as material,
    it cannot be destroyed by card effects. You can only use each of the following
    effects of \"Number 90: Galaxy-Eyes Photon Lord\" once per turn.\n\u25CF When
    an opponent's monster activates its effect (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material
    from this card; negate that monster's effect, and if the detached material was
    a \"Galaxy\" card, destroy that card.\n\u25CF During your opponent's turn (Quick
    Effect): You can take 1 \"Photon\" or \"Galaxy\" card from your Deck, and either
    add it to your hand or attach it to this card as material."
